OL,4,CItalian jeweller and businessman Paolo 
OL,5,CBulgari dies aged 89                   
OL,6,GItalian jeweller Paolo Bulgari, who    
OL,7,Ghelped turn his family's business into 
OL,8,Ga global luxury brand, has died in     
OL,9,GRome aged age 89.                      
OL,11,FHis family announced the news,         
OL,12,Fremembering him as "the greatest       
OL,13,Fjeweller of our time", according to    
OL,14,FItalian media.                         
OL,16,FPaolo Bulgari was Chairman of the      
OL,17,FBvlgari Group since 1984 and its       
OL,18,Fjewellery pieces have adorned          
OL,19,FHollywood stars and royalty including  
OL,20,FDiana, Princess of Wales.              
